## A note on third-party source materials

This work paraphrases and cites ideas from several third-party sources —
most notably *The Missing Readme: A Guide for the New Software Engineer*
by Chris Riccomini and Dmitriy Ryaboy (No Starch Press, 2021); Martin
Fowler's *Technical Debt Quadrant*; Michael Feathers' *Working Effectively
with Legacy Code* (Prentice Hall, 2004); Chris Beams' "How to Write a Git
